# A Journey Behind the Curtain
## Storytelling

I have been working with Cirk La Putyka for several years now, and over time it has become a very important part of my professional and personal life. My journey with the company became more significant in June last year, when I had the opportunity to collaborate on a new performance called St.art. After this experience, I gradually became more involved in the production and graphic departments, which allowed me to see the company from a different perspective.
I chose Cirk La Putyka as the main topic of my bachelor’s thesis because it is a company that is very close to me and I have developed a strong connection to its work. I have been part of it for several years, and it has naturally become something I truly care about.
For my thesis, I decided to focus on the redesign of the website. I believe that in today’s digital world, it is essential for a company to communicate its identity, values, and offers clearly online. Better presentation and education about the company through its website can significantly improve how people understand and connect with it.
In my work, I proposed several important improvements to the website so that it could better reflect the full scope of the company’s activities. This includes not only ticket sales and information about performances, but also sections dedicated to merchandise, the CLP Band, news and updates, and the people behind the company who are not always visible, even though they play an essential role.
I believe that presenting all of these aspects in a transparent and structured way helps audiences build a stronger relationship with the company. At the same time, it can also contribute to better engagement and ultimately higher ticket sales.
In my thesis, I also discuss the role of social media, which is an important communication tool today. However, I see the website as the main stable space where all information should come together in a clear and structured way.
Overall, my bachelor’s thesis is focused on something I would like to do in my future career — helping companies expand their communication, making their brand more accessible to people, and improving the way audiences understand and connect with them, which ultimately supports the growth and success of the company.
